A multi-module repo (two independent modules, NO go.work) where the same
golang.org/x/text v0.3.5 vulnerability (language.Parse, GO-2021-0113, fixed in
v0.3.7) is present in BOTH the root module example.com/foo and the nested child
module example.com/foo/sub. The DESIRED remediation bumps x/text to v0.3.7 in
both modules (root go.mod+go.sum AND sub/go.mod+sub/go.sum).

EXPECTED: FAIL.

GAP: the vulncheck bot script runs once at the repo root. `go run ...
govulncheck ./...` and the trailing `go mod tidy` only ever see the root module;
the nested module at sub/ has its own go.mod and is excluded from the root
module's package pattern. So the bot bumps golang.org/x/text to v0.3.7 in the
root module only, leaving sub/ pinned at the vulnerable v0.3.5. The real diff
therefore contains just the root go.mod/go.sum changes, while want_diff also
bumps sub/go.mod and sub/go.sum, so the case fails.
-- go.mod --
module example.com/foo

go 1.25.0

require golang.org/x/text v0.3.5
-- main.go --
package main

import (
	"fmt"

	"golang.org/x/text/language"
)

func main() {
	// language.Parse is the vulnerable symbol (GO-2021-0113); printing its
	// results directly keeps it on the call path so govulncheck flags it.
	fmt.Println(language.Parse("en-US"))
}
-- go.sum --
golang.org/x/text v0.3.5 h1:i6eZZ+zk0SOf0xgBpEpPD18qWcJda6q1sxt3S0kzyUQ=
golang.org/x/text v0.3.5/go.mod h1:5Zoc/QRtKVWzQhOtBMvqHzDpF6irO9z98xDceosuGiQ=
golang.org/x/tools v0.0.0-20180917221912-90fa682c2a6e/go.mod h1:n7NCudcB/nEzxVGmLbDWY5pfWTLqBcC2KZ6jyYvM4mQ=
-- sub/go.mod --
module example.com/foo/sub

go 1.25.0

require golang.org/x/text v0.3.5
-- sub/lib.go --
package sub

import (
	"fmt"

	"golang.org/x/text/language"
)

// ParseTag calls language.Parse, the vulnerable symbol in x/text v0.3.5.
func ParseTag(s string) {
	fmt.Println(language.Parse(s))
}
-- sub/go.sum --
golang.org/x/text v0.3.5 h1:i6eZZ+zk0SOf0xgBpEpPD18qWcJda6q1sxt3S0kzyUQ=
golang.org/x/text v0.3.5/go.mod h1:5Zoc/QRtKVWzQhOtBMvqHzDpF6irO9z98xDceosuGiQ=
golang.org/x/tools v0.0.0-20180917221912-90fa682c2a6e/go.mod h1:n7NCudcB/nEzxVGmLbDWY5pfWTLqBcC2KZ6jyYvM4mQ=
